# DinoChess STS suite (P6): 20 positions, 4 themes, fixed-depth verdicts.
# Format per line: <FEN6> bm <uci> [uci...]; [am <uci> [...];] id THEME.nn;
#   bm = acceptable best moves (any match solves; mate score also solves).
#   am = blunders (solves iff bestmove not among them).
# MATE positions are hand-verified mate-in-1 (see plan.md P6 log for the
# verification discipline: FEN pawn-count legality + engine 0000-probe).
# ANCHOR bm = depth-8 verdict on 2026-10-11 (regression tripwires, not truth).
# HARD bm = depth-12 verdict where depth-8 disagrees (upward headroom: deeper
# search is closer to truth; a future change that flips these to bm at depth
# 8 scores without needing 200 games to notice).
